      565.09,
      539.91,
      624.16
    ],
    "text": "KAATSU-Highly Advanced Medical Technology Training Centre (Pvt) Limited (KIU) shall, when admittingstudents for the degree programme specified in Schedule II hereto in respect of the Bachelor of Education Honours inPhysical Science, adhere to the minimum entry qualifications of three (03) \u2018S\u2019 passes among the subjects CombinedMathematics or Higher Mathematics, Chemistry, Physics, Information & Communication Technology and Mathematicsin one and the same sitting at the GCE (Advance Level) Examination or equivalent.",
